{"id":"diversamente","lemma":"diversamente","pos":"adv","rank":2282,"glosses":["in a different way, differently, otherwise"],"ipa":"/di.ver.saˈmen.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-XANA000-diversamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vedo la vita diversamente ora.","en":"I see life differently now.","words":[{"g":"to see","l":"vedere"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"life"},null,{"g":"now"}]},{"text":"Vedono le cose diversamente.","en":"They see things differently.","words":[{"g":"to see","l":"vedere"},{"g":"the / to her"},{"g":"thing","l":"cosa"},null]},{"text":"Io la penso diversamente.","en":"I think otherwise.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to think","l":"pensare"},null]},{"text":"Vedo la vita diversamente adesso.","en":"I see life differently now.","words":[{"g":"to see","l":"vedere"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"life"},null,{"g":"now"}]},{"text":"La penso diversamente.","en":"I think otherwise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1003208","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to think","l":"pensare"},null]}]}